nd the military hyundai because uh  in the past we all seen  the things and the violence they have  brought upon the people and  we all know we all know this and we are  going to  have to you know put an end to this so  uh  this is either the default or we do  sam thank you thank you for giving us  that perspective sam an activist in the  city of mandalay whose name we have  changed to protect his identity  you
 

